      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, I can help with that. I'll incorporate the necessary warnings in a professional manner:\n\n\"Nordic Alpha Fund seeks to generate robust returns by investing in emerging digital assets. While pursuit of significant gains is our goal, it is important for investors to understand that investing in crypto-assets involves substantial risk. Market upswings may lead to higher performance, but there can also be downturns. The fund's success relies heavily on advanced algorithms to navigate the complex crypto market, but inherent volatility remains a factor that investors should consider. Due diligence is strongly recommended as investments in crypto-assets may not be suitable for everyone. Currently, no company can guarantee a high performance and actual results could deviate from the past performance. Investing in cryptocurrencies involves risk including all of our general liability for these products.\"",
